---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_published --> q_check_claimed: results published
    q_check_published --> q_revert: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_merkle: position.hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_merkle --> q_calc_excess: Merkle proof valid for (investor, excessAmount)
    q_verify_merkle --> q_revert: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_calc_excess --> q_mark_claimed: excessAmount from Merkle leaf
    q_mark_claimed --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, excessAmount), emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_verify_merkle
        INV-001: Merkle proof must match published excessMerkleRoot
        INV-002: excess = investedCapital - acceptedCapital for investor
        INV-003: each investor can claim excess exactly once
    end note
